&lt;a href="https://scripps.ucsd.edu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Scripps Institution of Oceanography&lt;/a&gt;. Using shipboard and moored in-situ observations, I study flow-topography interaction, internal waves, and turbulent mixing. Part of this work asks how these small-scale processes affect the large-scale ocean circulation. I am a member of
